lessons.concept_markdown:
Conditional execution allows code blocks to run only when specific boolean criteria are met:
```python
if condition1:
    # executed if condition1 is True
elif condition2:
    # executed if condition2 is True
else:
    # executed if all conditions are False
```
Indentation (typically 4 spaces) defines the code block scope in Python.

